           :key "wh2_main_unit_passive_bloodshield_of_khaine",
           :ability-type "wh_type_area_of_ward_save",
           :description
           "Dark enchantments ensure that those who stand close to a Cauldron of Blood enjoy a degree of protection from the Bloody-handed God.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000119",
           :key "wh2_main_unit_passive_martial_mastery",
           :ability-type "wh_type_augment",
           :description
           "While all High Elves have excellent martial prowess, those that continue upon the path of the warrior will further excel in armed combat.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000011a",
           :key "wh2_main_unit_passive_martial_prowess",
           :ability-type "wh_type_augment",
           :description
           "High Elves excel as warriors, having trained in martial disciplines for the equivalent of many men's lifetimes.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000011b",
           :key "wh2_main_unit_passive_primal_instincts",
           :ability-type "wh_type_augment",
           :description
           "When under pressure, the primal instincts of these natural predators take over, improving their potential in combat.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000011c",
           :key "wh2_main_unit_passive_rebirth",
           :ability-type "wh_type_regeneration",
           :description "With strange aeons even death may die...",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000011d",
           :key "wh2_main_unit_passive_scurry_away",
           :ability-type "wh_type_augment",
           :description
           "\"He who runs away lives to fight another day!\" - so the foul, craven adage goes.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000011e",
           :key "wh2_main_unit_passive_snare_net",
           :ability-type "wh_type_hex",
           :description
           "Snare-nets are lightweight but strong and covered in hooks. They are used by Gutter Runners to capture live prisoners.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000011f",
           :key "wh2_main_unit_passive_strength_in_numbers",
           :ability-type "wh_type_augment",
           :description
           "Skaven are craven by nature but take courage when in packs of their own kind, where they move slower but enjoy the safety of numbers.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000120",
           :key "wh2_main_unit_passive_the_rats_emerge",
           :ability-type "wh_type_summon_unit",
           :description
           "Killing a Hell-Pit Abomination is never a simple matter; when it dies many fresh Skaven spawn to take its place.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000121",
           :key "wh2_main_unit_passive_too_horrible_to_die",
           :ability-type "wh_type_regeneration",
           :description
           "With its last, shuddering death throes there is a chance that one or more of the foul beast's many hearts will restart.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000122",
           :key "wh2_main_unit_passive_unbinding_clanrats_small",
           :ability-type "wh_type_direct_damage",
           :description
           "Summoned creatures exist in this world on borrowed time, disappearing back to the Winds from whence they came.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000123",
           :key "wh2_pro08_character_abilities_gotrek_doom",
           :ability-type "wh_type_augment",
           :description
           "By which the Dwarf Slayer and his mannish chronicler are protected from magical harm, forcing the foe into single combat they have little chance of surviving.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000124",
           :key "wh2_pro08_character_abilities_helping_hand",
           :ability-type "wh_type_augment",
           :description
           "Two blades are infinitely better than one - twice the attack, double the number of fell lives unceremoniously ended.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000125",
           :key "wh2_pro08_character_passive_blood_oath",
           :ability-type "wh_type_area_of_regeneration",
           :description
           "Gotrek's \"rememberer\" has pledged with his blood to record his friend the Dwarf Slayer's deeds until the day he finally joins his venerable Ancestors.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000126",
           :key "wh2_pro08_character_passive_heroic_fortitude",
           :ability-type "wh_type_regeneration",
           :description
           "Despite involving himself in the most dangerous situations imaginable, and against the Slayer's suicidally-brave will, Gotrek is made of sterner stuff even than others of his kind and can survive any hand-to-hand encounter.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000127",
           :key "wh2_twa03_lord_abilities_beastlords_gaze",
           :ability-type "wh_type_augment",
           :description
           "With a piercing stare, Rakarth makes known his innate cruelty and bloodlust to his beastly kindred spirits, thus subduing them.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000128",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_character_passive_acid_ichor",
           :ability-type "wh_type_augment",
           :description
           "The blood is transformed into a corrosive fluid. Deadly acid spurts from every wound.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000129",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_character_passive_soul_feeder",
           :ability-type "wh_type_regeneration",
           :description
           "Some hungers can only be sated by feeding on the souls of the slain.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000012a",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_lord_abilities_harbinger_of_pestilence",
           :ability-type "wh_type_area_of_direct_damage",
           :description
           "The Leechlord exudes waves of putrid infection, sickening his enemies as disease overcomes them.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000012b",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_lord_abilities_healing_elixirs",
           :ability-type "wh_type_area_of_regeneration",
           :description
           "Doktor Festus can heal as well as harm, he simply finds it far less enjoyable.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000012c",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_lord_abilities_tempest_rage",
           :ability-type "wh_type_augment",
           :description
           "Shining rays of light fall upon the worthy, riling the recipient into a violent frenzy.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000012d",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_lord_abilities_temptator",
           :ability-type "wh_type_augment",
           :description
           "To face Azazel is to gamble with one’s very soul, lose free will, and be used as his plaything.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000012e",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_lord_passive_domineering_aura",
           :ability-type "wh_type_area_of_hexes",
           :description
           "The mere presence of one so mighty has the enemy gripped by fear, weakened by their own self-doubt.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000012f",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_lord_passive_paragon_of_carnage",
           :ability-type "wh_type_area_of_augments",
           :description
           "Those who behold such rage incarnate would surely stare in awe, were their heads not promptly removed from their bodies.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000130",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_lord_passive_paragon_of_change",
           :ability-type "wh_type_area_of_regeneration",
           :description
           "The magic of Tzeentch forms a protective barrier, continually strengthened according to the Wind-Lord's whims.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000131",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_lord_passive_paragon_of_decay",
           :ability-type "wh_type_area_of_hexes",
           :description
           "All who wade through such a deadly aura of decay are visibly weakened by Nurgle's vile afflictions.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000132",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_lord_passive_paragon_of_excess",
           :ability-type "wh_type_area_of_hexes",
           :description
           "Who could strike at such a tempting figure? After all, it would be a shame to mar such beguiling beauty.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000133",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_lord_passive_paragon_of_ruin",
           :ability-type "wh_type_area_of_augments",
           :description
           "The Warriors of Chaos gather behind a force of almighty carnage, empowered by the very presence of their barbarous Lord.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000134",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_lord_passive_the_gaze_of_khorne",
           :ability-type "wh_type_area_of_augments",
           :description
           "Khorne's warriors follow Valkia without question, for her strength has been proven time and again at the point of her spear.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000135",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_lord_passive_the_twisted_twin",
           :ability-type "wh_type_augment",
           :description
           "Vilitch thrives in the midst of battle, revelling in the use of his strength and sorcery combined.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000136",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_spell_bound_gehennas_golden_hounds",
           :ability-type "wh_type_vortex",
           :description
           "Blowing on a glimmering golden whistle, the Wizard summons the spirit of Gehenna’s metal hounds to hunt down his prey.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000137",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_spell_bound_stream_of_corruption",
           :ability-type "wh_type_breath",
           :description
           "A poisonous spurt of diseased gas and bile spews forth from the spellcaster's diseased lungs, drenching the enemy in vile, choking pus.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000138",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_spell_bound_the_penumbral_pendulum",
           :ability-type "wh_type_wind",
           :description
           "A spectral pendulum is summoned by the Wizard. On command, it swings, razor sharp and with lethal speed, through the foe.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000139",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_unit_abilities_violent_wind",
           :ability-type "wh_type_vortex",
           :description
           "'Better out than in' is a questionable maxim—particularly for the unfortunates caught in this deadly, reeking draught.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000013a",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_unit_passive_giver_of_abundant_glory",
           :ability-type "wh_type_area_of_augments",
           :description
           "Where bodies fall, life springs once more, healing the wounded among the warriors of Nurgle.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000013b",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_unit_passive_giver_of_arcane_glory",
           :ability-type "wh_type_area_of_augments",
           :description
           "Death is but a source of power, where the lifeblood of one may fuel the arcane wizardry of another.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000013c",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_unit_passive_giver_of_furious_glory",
           :ability-type "wh_type_area_of_augments",
           :description
           "Khorne blesses his warriors for every enemy slain, feasting on their suffering and screams.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000013d",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_unit_passive_giver_of_glory",
           :ability-type "wh_type_area_of_augments",
           :description
           "The shrinemaster implores the fickle Chaos Gods for their aid, bestowing their dark blessings upon nearby champions.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000013e",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_unit_passive_giver_of_torturous_glory",
           :ability-type "wh_type_area_of_direct_damage",
           :description
           "Agonising pain is but a thrilling delight for Slaanesh, who revels in inflicting such torture on his foes.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000013f",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_unit_passive_murderous_charge",
           :ability-type "wh_type_augment",
           :description
           "All in the path of this murderous rampage will have little chance to react before being trampled into a fine red mist.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000140",
           :key "wh3_dlc20_unit_passive_supreme_vanity",
           :ability-type "wh_type_area_of_augments",
           :description
           "What could spur one to greater heights of glory than the sight of one's own exquisite visage, reflected in mirrored shields.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000141",
           :key "wh3_dlc23_character_abilities_reforge",
           :ability-type "wh_type_regeneration",
           :description
           "By which even those born of fire and flame, deep within the forge, can be healed.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000142",
           :key "wh3_dlc23_character_abilities_skjalandirs_fall",
           :ability-type "wh_type_augment",
           :description
           "An aim so sharp – and a shot so precise – that it took the eye of a Dragon and saved Gotrek's life; woe betide any on the receiving end of Ulrika's bow and arrow!",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000143",
           :key "wh3_dlc23_character_abilities_sword_dance",
           :ability-type "wh_type_augment",
           :description
           "So graceful are her movements, and so precise her attacks, that to see Ulrika in the midst of battle is almost like witnessing a dance, rather than a slaughter.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000144",
           :key "wh3_dlc23_character_passive_infernal_engineer",
           :ability-type "wh_type_area_of_augments",
           :description
           "There are always improvements that can be made to any process; this one ensures the Chaos Dwarfs' war machines and artillery are calibrated to perfection.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000145",
           :key "wh3_dlc23_hero_abilities_crooked_dice",
           :ability-type "wh_type_augment",
           :description
           "Anything that prevents you from killing your opponents in a fit of bad-loser's pique on more than one occasion, and then having to clear up the mess yourself afterwards, is a good thing. Now, the odds *always* swing in your favour.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000146",
           :key "wh3_dlc23_hero_passive_lucky_git",
           :ability-type "wh_type_regeneration",
           :description
           "\"You lucky git. You lucky, lucky git. You lucky, lucky, lucky git. You lu--\"",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000147",
           :key "wh3_dlc23_hero_passive_the_hunger",
           :ability-type "wh_type_regeneration",
           :description
           "As the Vampires rip apart their victims they feast on the blood that spills forth – gaining in strength and lost stamina.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000148",
           :key "wh3_dlc23_lord_abilities_sadistic_snare",
           :ability-type "wh_type_hex",
           :description
           "The beauty in totally immobilising an enemy is that you can decide precisely how they will die.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000149",
           :key "wh3_dlc23_lord_passive_boundless_cruelty",
           :ability-type "wh_type_area_of_hexes",
           :description
           "The Black's crimes are without number and his villainy without end, for Zhatan is savagery personified.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000014a",
           :key "wh3_dlc23_lord_passive_dark_renown",
           :ability-type "wh_type_area_of_augments",
           :description
           "Grown and built upon across the centuries of his banishment, Drazhoath's endless contempt for all life is a tangible thing, and a power in its own right.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000014b",
           :key "wh3_dlc23_lord_passive_mechanical_overdrive",
           :ability-type "wh_type_augment",
           :description
           "Murder itself drives the machine, so the more it kills, the more it *can* kill. Diabolical ingenuity!",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000014c",
           :key "wh3_dlc23_mount_passive_horseback_prodigy",
           :ability-type "wh_type_augment",
           :description
           "Some people just seem to have been born in the saddle, such is the quality of their natural horsemanship. Ulrika is one such person.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000014d",
           :key "wh3_dlc23_spell_bound_enfeebling_foe",
           :ability-type "wh_type_hex",
           :description
           "By means of the Lore of Shadows, the Wizard causes the enemy to be worn down by their own burdens, until they are enervated to a sorry standstill.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000014e",
           :key "wh3_dlc23_spell_bound_the_withering",
           :ability-type "wh_type_hex",
           :description
           "The Wizard destroys the foe from within, corroding their minds with doubt and crisis.",
           :game
           [:game/eid #uuid "eea787d7-1065-45eb-a3f6-e26f32c294a1"]}
 #:ability{:eid #uuid "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000014f",
           :key "wh3_dlc23_unit_abilities_flaming_breath",
